<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber on oil service stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber on oil service stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated a group of oil service stocks, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- started coverage of Veritas DGC Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- initiated the following as attractive: Halliburton Co, Baker Hughes Inc Dresser Industries Inc, and BJ Services.</p>
<p>-- Veritas rose 7/8 to 20, Halliburton gained 3/8 to 67, Baker Hughes was up 1/4 to 35-3/8, Dresser added 3/8 to 28-7/8, and BJ Services was up 5/8 to 46.</p>
</text>
